# Latte + PHP themes

Full docs: [`docs/latte-primitives.md`](../../docs/latte-primitives.md), [`docs/architecture.md`](../../docs/architecture.md)

## Composition

```latte
{capture $label}Explore{/capture}
{include 'button/Button.latte', variant: 'default', children: (string) $label}
```

Loader roots: theme `views/` → `kit/ui` → `ui8kit/ui` (UI8Kit 3; see `ui8kit3.mdc`).

## Skipped Latte parts (use `Classes::*`)

`Breadcrumb`, `Select`, `Icon` — see codegen `docs/php-complex-parts.md`.

No React `asChild`: `Classes::buttonClasses(…)` on a manual `<a>`.

## PHP

- Namespace under theme slug (`WPFasty\` for reference)
- PSR-4, strict types, DI `Container`, bootable services
- Escape on output; i18n text domain = theme slug
- Reference: Container, ContextFactory, LatteEngine, WordPressExtension, MultiRootLoader in `themes/latte`
- Compose views from presets + UI8Kit primitives

